:: Deadwood Robin Independent Note []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<lanSwitch 'You unfold Robin’s note. Some lines have been crossed out and written again.' '你展开罗宾的纸条。有几句话被划掉，又重新写了一遍。'>>
<br><br><i>
<<lanSwitch 'I have tried to say this to you in person, but every time you look at me I forget the words. You stayed beside me while I learned to keep the accounts and make my own decisions. I am glad I can stand on my own feet now, with you still beside me.' '我一直想当面告诉你。可每次你看着我，我就把准备好的话忘得一干二净。你陪着我学会记账，也陪着我自己作决定。我很高兴自己终于能站稳，而你还在我身边。'>>
<br><br>
<<lanSwitch 'When you come by the stall, I start looking for you before I even hear your steps. When you take my hand, I wish you would stay a little longer. I care about you for reasons that do not fit anywhere in the ledger.' '你来摊位时，我还没听见脚步声，就已经在找你了。你牵住我的手时，我总希望你能再多待一会。我喜欢你，这件事怎么也写不进账本。'>>
<br><br>
<<lanSwitch 'Would you be my' '你愿意做我的'>> <<girlfriend>>?<br>
<<if isCrossdressing() or $backgroundTraits.includes('crossdresser')>>
  <<lanSwitch 'If another word feels better, tell me. I want to call you what you choose.' '如果你更喜欢别的称呼，请告诉我。我想用你自己喜欢的那个。'>><br>
<</if>>
<<lanSwitch 'You can say no. I still want us to be able to talk tomorrow.' '你可以拒绝。我还是想在明天见到你，好好和你说话。'>>
<br><br><<lanSwitch 'Robin' '罗宾'>>
</i>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '收好纸条' 'Bedroom'>><</lanLink>>
